 <subsection title="SIMD Floating-Point Exceptions">
  <para unique="1046170">VEX-encoded instructions: Invalid.</para>
  <para unique="1046171">EVEX-encoded instructions: Invalid.</para>
  <para unique="1046172">EVEX-encoded instructions with broadcast (VCVTPH2PSX): Invalid, Denormal.</para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Other Exceptions">
  <para unique="1046177">VEX-encoded instructions, see <link unique="1046175" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#95191: 06_Table: Table 2-26. Type 11 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page">Table&#160;2&#8209;26, &#8220;Type 11 Class Exception Conditions&#8221;</link> (do not report #AC).</para>
  <para unique="1046181">EVEX-encoded instructions, see <link unique="1046179" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#46736: 06_Table: Table 2-60. Type E11 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page with period">Table&#160;2&#8209;62, &#8220;Type E11 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  <para unique="1046182">EVEX-encoded instructions with broadcast (VCVTPH2PSX), see Table 2-46, &#8220;Type E2 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</para>
  <para unique="1046183">Additionally:</para>
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term>#UD</term>
    <listitem><para unique="1046184">If VEX.W=1.</para>
     </listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term>#UD</term>
    <listitem><para unique="1046185">If VEX.vvvv != 1111B or EVEX.vvvv != 1111B.</para>
     </listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   </variablelist>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
